---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
const title = "Mening yo'lim | Tayanch";
const description = "Tayanch asoschisining halol hikoyasi: mustaqil o'rganish, admission yo'li, o'qituvchilik va AI bilan amaliy muammolarni yechish haqida.";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="hero-j">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="jour.eyebrow">ASOSCHI HIKOYASI</span>
    <h1 data-i18n="nav.journey">Mening yo'lim</h1>
    <p class="lead" data-i18n="jour.lead">Bu reklama emas. Bu men nimani boshdan kechirganim, nimani o'rganganim va nima uchun Tayanch’ni yaratayotganim haqidagi halol hikoya.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="story-intro" aria-label="Qisqa tanishuv">
    <p class="story-quote">“Ikki marta o'lcha, bir marta kes.”</p>
    <p>Bu otamdan o'rgangan qoida. Men uchun u faqat qurilish haqida emas: qarorni tekshirish, resursni qadrlash va shoshmasdan ish qilish haqida.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="journey">
    <article class="step">
      <div class="step-no">01</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <p class="step-kicker" data-i18n="jour.k1">BOSHLANISH NUQTASI</p>
        <h2 data-i18n="jour.s1">Otam bilan qurilishda</h2>
        <p>Otam bilan qurilish ishlarida yurgan paytlarimda beton quyish, devor pardozlash, kafel yotqizish va material hisoblash bilan tanishdim. Oshxonamizdagi ta'mirda o'lchovni xato olganimda, otam kesishdan oldin uni yana tekshirdi.</p>
        <p>O'shanda bitta xato faqat bitta detalni emas, keyingi ishlarni ham buzishini ko'rdim. Muhandislikka qiziqishim ham shu yerdan boshlandi: yechim topishdan oldin muammoni aniq ko'rish kerak.</p>
        <p class="lesson"><b>Saboq:</b> Asos mustahkam bo'lmasa, ustiga hech narsa turmaydi — nafaqat devorda, hayotda ham.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="step">
      <div class="step-no">02</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <p class="step-kicker" data-i18n="jour.k2">QIYIN DAVR</p>
        <h2 data-i18n="jour.s2">Pullik kurs kutmasdan o'rganish</h2>
        <p>Oilamizdagi moliyaviy qiyinchiliklar sabab IELTS kursini tark etib, mustaqil tayyorlandim. Menda mukammal sharoit yo'q edi: bepul Telegram materiallari, muntazam amaliy testlar va bor resursni to'g'ri ishlatish bor edi.</p>
        <p>IELTS imtihoniga ro'yxatdan o'tish to'lovini qoplash uchun hovlimizdagi daraxtlar ham sotilgan. Bu tajriba men uchun juda shaxsiy, lekin aynan u bilimning narxini boshqacha tushunishga yordam berdi.</p>
        <p>Shu yo'lda IELTS 7.0 va SAT 1420 natijalariga erishdim.</p>
        <p class="lesson"><b>Saboq:</b> To'g'ri usul va izchillik bo'lsa, qimmat kurs imkoniyatning yagona yo'li emas.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="step">
      <div class="step-no">03</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <p class="step-kicker" data-i18n="jour.k3">DAVOM ETISH</p>
        <h2 data-i18n="jour.s3">Gap year va mehnat</h2>
        <p>2025–2026-yillardagi gap year davrida oilamni qo'llab-quvvatlash uchun yuk ortish-tushirish ishida ishladim. Ayrim kunlari tungi va kunduzgi smenalar ulanib, juda kam uxlab davom etishga to'g'ri kelgan.</p>
        <p>Bu davr oson bo'lmagan. Ammo u menga intizom motivatsiya kelishini kutish emasligini o'rgatdi: natija darhol ko'rinmasa ham, davom etish kerak.</p>
        <p class="lesson"><b>Saboq:</b> Qiyin sharoit rejangizni o'zgartirishi mumkin, lekin maqsadingizni bekor qilishi shart emas.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="step">
      <div class="step-no">04</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <p class="step-kicker" data-i18n="jour.k4">BURILISH NUQTASI</p>
        <h2 data-i18n="jour.s4">AI — vaqtni bo'shatadigan vosita</h2>
        <p>Bo'sh vaqt topilganida BIM, Revit, AutoCAD, Digital Twin, Calculus I va prompt engineeringni mustaqil o'rgandim. AutoCAD’dagi takrorlanuvchi chizma detalini qo'lda qayta-qayta bajarish o'rniga, AI yordamida AutoLISP skripti yaratdim.</p>
        <p>Natijada avval ikki soat ketadigan ish 15 daqiqaga tushdi. Shu tajriba AI insonning fikrlashi o'rnini bosishi uchun emas, balki muhimroq tekshiruv, hisob-kitob va qarorlar uchun vaqt bo'shatishi kerakligini ko'rsatdi.</p>
        <p class="lesson"><b>Saboq:</b> Texnologiya maqsad emas. U tartib, mas'uliyat va aniq natija bilan birga ishlaydigan vosita.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="step">
      <div class="step-no">05</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <p class="step-kicker" data-i18n="jour.k5">BILIMNI ULASHISH</p>
        <h2 data-i18n="jour.s5">O'qituvchilik tajribasi</h2>
        <p>Sydney School’da 40 dan ortiq o'quvchiga ingliz tili, speaking va IELTS/CEFR tayyorgarligi bo'yicha dars berdim. Har bir o'quvchining savoli, tezligi va qiyinchiligi boshqacha edi.</p>
        <p>O'rgatish uchun avval o'zingiz tushunishingiz, keyin esa fikrni boshqaga sodda va amaliy qilib yetkazishingiz kerak. O'quvchining natijasi o'zgarganini ko'rish bilimni tizimlashtirish qanchalik katta mas'uliyat ekanini his qildirdi.</p>
        <p class="lesson"><b>Saboq:</b> Bilim uni boshqalar ham ochib, foydalana olganida kuchliroq bo'ladi.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="step">
      <div class="step-no">06</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <p class="step-kicker" data-i18n="jour.k6">BUGUNGI HOLAT</p>
        <h2 data-i18n="jour.s6">Nega Tayanch bor?</h2>
        <p>Admission yo'limda 18 ta tasdiqlangan qabul xati va jami $1.1M dan ortiq stipendiya takliflariga erishdim. Lekin bu yo'l menga bitta narsani ko'rsatdi: qobiliyatning o'zi kamlik qiladi. Ko'p odamga tizim, aniq yo'l va ishonch yetishmaydi.</p>
        <p>Shuning uchun Tayanch’da AI, IELTS va Admission bo'yicha kurslarni yaratmoqdaman. Ular tayyor javob berish uchun emas, o'quvchiga o'z muammosini tushunish, tizim qurish va keyingi qadamini tanlashga yordam berish uchun yaratiladi.</p>
        <p>Uzoq muddatli maqsadim — imkoniyati cheklangan, ammo iqtidorli yoshlar uchun grant asosidagi STEM ta'limini beradigan Muhandislik Akademiyasini qurish. Tayanch — shu katta maqsadning kichik, ammo real boshlanishi.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <section class="proof-section" aria-labelledby="proof-title">
    <div class="proof-heading">
      <p class="step-kicker" data-i18n="jour.pk">YO‘LIMDAGI NATIJALAR</p>
      <h2 id="proof-title" data-i18n="jour.ph2">Hujjatlar bilan tasdiqlangan namunalar</h2>
      <p data-i18n="jour.pdesc">Bu yerda faqat zarur natija ko‘rsatkichlari qoldirilgan. Shaxsiy ma’lumotlar, identifikatorlar va moliyaviy tafsilotlar yashirilgan.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="excerpt-intro">
      <p class="excerpt-label" data-i18n="jour.ek">TAJRIBA VA ARIZA HIKOYASI</p>
      <p data-i18n="jour.edesc">Quyidagi kartalar original sahifalarning nusxasi emas: ular maxfiy ma’lumotlarsiz, umumlashtirilgan excerpt sifatida qayta tuzilgan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="excerpt-grid" aria-label="CV va essaylardan redakt qilingan namunalar">
      <figure class="proof-card"><img class="proof-image" src={base + 'proof/mening-yolim/cv-project-leadership-preview.webp'} alt="Redacted self-reported CV project and leadership excerpt" loading="lazy" draggable="false" /><figcaption>CV excerpt · self-reported background</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="proof-card"><img class="proof-image" src={base + 'proof/mening-yolim/essay-learning-excerpt.webp'} alt="Redacted personal essay learning excerpt" loading="lazy" draggable="false" /><figcaption>Personal essay · learning reflection</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="proof-card"><img class="proof-image" src={base + 'proof/mening-yolim/essay-gap-year-excerpt.webp'} alt="Redacted personal essay gap year excerpt" loading="lazy" draggable="false" /><figcaption>Personal essay · gap-year reflection</figcaption></figure>
    </div>

    <div class="score-proof-grid" aria-label="IELTS va SAT natijalari">
      <figure class="proof-card score-proof"><img class="proof-image" src={base + 'proof/mening-yolim/ielts-score-preview.webp'} alt="IELTS Academic score summary: Overall 7.0" loading="lazy" draggable="false" /><figcaption>IELTS Academic · Overall 7.0</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="proof-card score-proof"><img class="proof-image" src={base + 'proof/mening-yolim/sat-score-preview.webp'} alt="SAT score summary: Total 1420" loading="lazy" draggable="false" /><figcaption>SAT · Total score 1420</figcaption></figure>
    </div>

    <div class="acceptance-intro">
      <div><span class="proof-count">18</span><span data-i18n="jour.accLabel">ta tasdiqlangan qabul xati</span></div>
      <p data-i18n="jour.accDesc">Quyida turli yo‘nalish va mamlakatlardagi oltita namuna. Har birida faqat universitet, ijobiy qaror, dastur va qabul yili qoldirilgan.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="acceptance-grid" aria-label="Qabul xatlari namunalari">
      <figure class="proof-card"><img class="proof-image" src={base + 'proof/mening-yolim/purdue-university.webp'} alt="Purdue University offer of admission preview" loading="lazy" draggable="false" /><figcaption>Purdue University · Fall 2026</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="proof-card"><img class="proof-image" src={base + 'proof/mening-yolim/university-of-birmingham.webp'} alt="University of Birmingham conditional offer preview" loading="lazy" draggable="false" /><figcaption>University of Birmingham · Conditional offer</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="proof-card"><img class="proof-image" src={base + 'proof/mening-yolim/university-of-oregon.webp'} alt="University of Oregon offer of admission preview" loading="lazy" draggable="false" /><figcaption>University of Oregon · Fall 2026</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="proof-card"><img class="proof-image" src={base + 'proof/mening-yolim/university-of-alberta.webp'} alt="University of Alberta unconditional admission preview" loading="lazy" draggable="false" /><figcaption>University of Alberta · Unconditional admission</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="proof-card"><img class="proof-image" src={base + 'proof/mening-yolim/university-of-victoria.webp'} alt="University of Victoria letter of acceptance preview" loading="lazy" draggable="false" /><figcaption>University of Victoria · Letter of acceptance</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="proof-card"><img class="proof-image" src={base + 'proof/mening-yolim/miami-university.webp'} alt="Miami University offer of admission preview" loading="lazy" draggable="false" /><figcaption>Miami University · Fall 2026</figcaption></figure>
    </div>

    <details class="more-acceptances">
      <summary data-i18n="jour.more">Qolgan 12 ta tasdiqlangan qabul xati</summary>
      <p>ASU London · Hope College · Illinois College · Kent State University · Le Moyne College · Missouri University of Science and Technology · University of Cincinnati · University of Delaware · University of New Haven · University of Southern Mississippi · University of Oklahoma · Western New England University</p>
    </details>

    <p class="proof-note">Previewlar faqat ma’lumot uchun: original hujjat emas va verifikatsiya uchun yaroqsiz. Saqlash/yuklab olish funksiyasi berilmagan; screenshot olishning oldini to‘liq olib bo‘lmasligini yodda tuting.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="story-cta" aria-labelledby="story-cta-title">
    <p class="story-cta-kicker" data-i18n="jour.ck">KEYINGI QADAM</p>
    <h2 id="story-cta-title" data-i18n="jour.ch2">Sizning yo'lingiz ham shu yerdan boshlanishi mumkin.</h2>
    <p data-i18n="jour.cdesc">Hozir qaysi yo'nalish sizga ko'proq mosligini aniqlang va o'zingiz uchun amaliy reja tuzishni boshlang.</p>
    <a class="start-btn" href={base + 'kurs-tanlash/'} data-i18n="jour.cbtn">Kurs tanlash testini boshlash →</a>
  </section>

  <script>
    document.querySelectorAll('.proof-image').forEach((image) => {
      image.addEventListener('contextmenu', (event) => event.preventDefault());
      image.addEventListener('dragstart', (event) => event.preventDefault());
    });
  </script>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-j { text-align:center; padding:64px 20px 24px; }
  .hero-j .eyebrow,.step-kicker,.story-cta-kicker { display:inline-block; margin:0 0 .6rem; color:var(--accent); font-size:.78rem; letter-spacing:.12em; font-weight:800; }
  .hero-j h1 { margin:0 0 .9rem; font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.6rem); letter-spacing:-.035em; }
  .hero-j .lead { max-width:720px; margin:0 auto; color:var(--muted); font-size:1.08rem; line-height:1.7; }
  .story-intro { max-width:760px; margin:1.6rem auto 0; padding:1.5rem 1.7rem; border-left:3px solid var(--accent); background:var(--accent-soft); border-radius:0 14px 14px 0; }
  .story-intro p { margin:.45rem 0 0; color:var(--text); line-height:1.7; }
  .story-intro .story-quote { margin:0; color:var(--accent); font-size:1.25rem; font-weight:800; }
  .journey { position:relative; max-width:820px; margin:3.2rem auto 0; padding:0 20px; }
  .journey::before { content:""; position:absolute; left:46px; top:20px; bottom:44px; width:1px; background:var(--border); }
  .step { position:relative; display:grid; grid-template-columns:54px 1fr; gap:22px; margin:0 0 2.2rem; }
  .step-no { position:relative; z-index:1; width:54px; height:54px; display:grid; place-items:center; border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 60%,var(--border)); border-radius:50%; background:var(--surface); color:var(--accent); font-size:.82rem; font-weight:800; }
  .step-body { padding:1.55rem 1.65rem; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:16px; background:var(--surface); box-shadow:var(--shadow); }
  .step-body h2 { margin:0 0 .75rem; font-size:1.38rem; letter-spacing:-.015em; }
  .step-body p { margin:.65rem 0; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.75; }
  .step-body .step-kicker { margin:0 0 .35rem; }
  .step-body .lesson { margin:1rem 0 0; padding:.9rem 1rem; border-radius:10px; background:var(--accent-soft); color:var(--text); }
  .proof-section { max-width:820px; margin:1rem auto 3rem; padding:2.25rem; border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 45%,var(--border)); border-radius:20px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 10%,var(--surface)),var(--surface)); }
  .proof-heading { max-width:650px; }
  .proof-heading h2 { margin:.05rem 0 .65rem; font-size:clamp(1.55rem,3vw,2.1rem); letter-spacing:-.025em; }
  .proof-heading > p:last-child,.proof-note { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.7; }
  .excerpt-intro { margin:1.5rem 0 .8rem; padding-top:1.2rem; border-top:1px solid var(--border); }
  .excerpt-intro p { margin:.35rem 0 0; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.65; }
  .excerpt-label { color:var(--accent) !important; font-size:.76rem; font-weight:850; letter-spacing:.1em; }
  .excerpt-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1rem; margin:0 0 1.5rem; }
  .score-proof-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1rem; margin:1.5rem 0; }
  .acceptance-intro { display:grid; grid-template-columns:180px 1fr; gap:1.25rem; align-items:center; margin:1.7rem 0 1.1rem; padding:1.2rem; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:14px; background:var(--surface); }
  .acceptance-intro > div { display:flex; flex-direction:column; color:var(--muted); font-weight:700; }
  .proof-count { color:var(--accent); font-size:3.1rem; font-weight:850; line-height:1; }
  .acceptance-intro p { margin:0; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.65; }
  .acceptance-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1rem; }
  .proof-card { margin:0; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:14px; background:var(--surface); box-shadow:var(--shadow); }
  .proof-image { display:block; width:100%; aspect-ratio:16/9; object-fit:cover; user-select:none; -webkit-user-drag:none; }
  .score-proof .proof-image { object-fit:contain; background:#0e0f15; }
  .proof-card figcaption { padding:.72rem .85rem; color:var(--muted); font-size:.84rem; font-weight:700; }
  .more-acceptances { margin:1rem 0 0; padding:1rem 1.1rem; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; background:var(--surface); }
  .more-acceptances summary { cursor:pointer; color:var(--text); font-weight:800; }
  .more-acceptances p { margin:.8rem 0 0; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.7; }
  .proof-note { margin:1rem 0 0; font-size:.8rem; }
  .story-cta { max-width:820px; margin:1rem auto 4rem; padding:2.4rem; text-align:center; border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 45%,var(--border)); border-radius:20px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 15%,var(--surface)),var(--surface)); }
  .story-cta h2 { max-width:580px; margin:0 auto .8rem; font-size:clamp(1.55rem,3vw,2.1rem); letter-spacing:-.025em; }
  .story-cta p { max-width:590px; margin:0 auto 1.35rem; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.65; }
  @media (max-width:620px) { .hero-j { padding-top:42px; } .story-intro { margin-left:0; margin-right:0; padding:1.2rem; } .journey { padding:0; } .journey::before { left:23px; } .step { grid-template-columns:46px 1fr; gap:12px; } .step-no { width:46px; height:46px; font-size:.72rem; } .step-body { padding:1.25rem; } .proof-section { padding:1.3rem; } .excerpt-grid,.score-proof-grid,.acceptance-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .acceptance-intro { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:.7rem; } .story-cta { padding:1.7rem 1.2rem; } }
</style>
